The project guidance is vendor-neutral and lives in `AGENTS.md` at the repo
root. Read it before editing, then follow its links into `docs/`.

Quick orientation: pnpm workspace with `apps/frontend` (Vue 3 modular monolith:
feature modules behind `index.ts` facades) and two source-first packages,
`packages/design-system` (domain-free UI kit) and `packages/types`. Deep docs:
`docs/architecture.md`, `docs/styling.md`, `docs/formatting.md`,
`docs/testing.md`, `docs/design-system.md`, `docs/specs/bookstore.md`.
